<title>ISRAEL: Israel approves privatisation of oil company.</title>
<headline>Israel approves privatisation of oil company.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's parliamentary finance committee on Tuesday gave final approval to privatisation of the National Oil Company Ltd, a committee statement said.</p>
<p>&quot;The finance committee authorised today the decision of the ministerial committee on privatisation to privatise the National Oil Company Ltd,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>It said the oil exploration company, wholly state-owned, would be sold via private sale to either local or foreign investors. No date has been set for the offering.</p>
</text>
